        "networks modeled after the human brain to tackle complex tasks like image recognition.\n",
        "\n",
        "AI’s applications span numerous industries. In healthcare, it powers diagnostic tools that detect diseases like cancer from medical imaging and crafts\n",
        "personalized treatment plans based on patient data. In finance, AI algorithms monitor transactions to catch fraud in real-time and execute high-speed stock\n",
        "trades. Transportation benefits from AI through self-driving cars, which use sensors and algorithms to navigate roads safely. Virtual assistants like Siri\n",
        "and Alexa employ natural language processing to interpret and respond to human speech, making technology more accessible. Beyond these, AI enhances\n",
        "manufacturing with predictive maintenance, optimizes supply chains, and even generates art or music through creative algorithms.\n",
        "\n",
