        "retail and transportation. Privacy worries grow as AI systems collect and analyze personal data, often without clear consent. Biased algorithms, trained on\n",
        "flawed datasets, can perpetuate discrimination in areas like hiring or law enforcement. Additionally, the energy consumption of training large AI models\n",
        "contributes to environmental debates.\n",
        "\n",
        "Looking ahead, AI research is pushing toward general AI—systems with the flexibility to handle any intellectual task a human can—unlike today’s narrow AI,\n",
